WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Juri jumps forward and begins OD Shikusen.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.500
OD Shikusen hits the grounded Ryu.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
The repeated heavy-kick follow-up extends the juggle.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Heavy Tensenrin catches Ryu after Juri lands.

5
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Ryu lands after the heavy-DP finish.
